ype":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30160,"speakerName":"朝霧","textMapHash":2451953154,"text":"はぁ…私の体がもう少し元気だったら、君のように旅へ出たのにな。","nextNodeIds":[725010206]},{"nodeId":725010206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30160,"speakerName":"朝霧","textMapHash":3825559690,"text":"そうすれば、毎日森子さんと顔を合わせて催促されることもないのに…","nextNodeIds":[725010207]},{"nodeId":725010207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30160,"speakerName":"朝霧","textMapHash":2294678186,"text":"以前、描いた原稿が好評だったんだ。たくさんの先生が私を指名して、挿し絵を描いて欲しいって言ってるの。","nextNodeIds":[725010230]},{"nodeId":725010230,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30160,"speakerName":"朝霧","textMapHash":2813081114,"text":"森子さんのほうで結構依頼を断ってくれたんだ。でも、まだ残っているものも多くて…","nextNodeIds":[725010209]},{"nodeId":725010208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30160,"speakerName":"朝霧","textMapHash":2301728314,"text":"その上、「八重堂」の先生たちが書く小説の題材が…ますます大きくなってて…","nextNodeIds":[725010209]},{"nodeId":725010209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30160,"speakerName":"朝霧","textMapHash":1901097290,"text":"はじめは稲妻以外だと、せいぜいモンドや璃月のことを書くくらいだったのに…","nextNodeIds":[725010210]},{"nodeId":725010210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30160,"speakerName":"朝霧","textMapHash":2959708890,"text":"今では先生たちの書く題材が…スメールまで足を伸ばしてるの。しかも、フォンテーヌにも目を付けてるみたい。","nextNodeIds":[725010216]},{"nodeId":725010216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30160,"speakerName":"朝霧","textMapHash":3641223602,"text":"それで…本題に戻るとして……旅人、あの「写真機」ってまだ使えるよね…","nextNodeIds":[725010217,725010218]},{"nodeId":725010217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4088272906,"text":"まだ使えると思う…","nextNodeIds":[725010219]},{"nodeId":725010218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1884341138,"text":"また写真を撮って欲しいの？","nextNodeIds":[725010219]},{"nodeId":725010219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30160,"speakerName":"朝霧","textMapHash":2718078010,"text":"ほら、この間の私の報酬って悪くなかったでしょ？","nextNodeIds":[725010220]},{"nodeId":725010220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30160,"speakerName":"朝霧","textMapHash":2817760242,"text":"だから旅人、もう一回世界各地を回って、写真を撮って来てほしいの！","nextNodeIds":[725010221,725010224]},{"nodeId":725010221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1483162930,"text":"うん、任せて…","nextNodeIds":[725010222]},{"nodeId":725010224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":945159314,"text":"冒険者協会に依頼を出して…","nextNodeIds":[725010225]},{"nodeId":725010222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30160,"speakerName":"朝霧","textMapHash":4071271682,"text":"じゃあ、君に任せたよ！へへっ、実はもう帳面を用意しておいたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[725010223]},{"nodeId":725010223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30160,"speakerName":"朝霧","textMapHash":3689462898,"text":"もし君が来てくれなかったら、森子さんに頼んで探してもらうところだったよ…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":725010225,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30160,"speakerName":"朝霧","textMapHash":2941236298,"text":"えぇっ！待って！お願い、お願いだよ！冒険者協会に依頼を出したことはあるけど、写真機を使いこなせる冒険者が見つからないの！","nextNodeIds":[725010226]},{"nodeId":725010226,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30160,"speakerName":"朝霧","textMapHash":3751776258,"text":"旅人、私を助けると思ってさ。もし原稿を出せなかったら、森子さんがまた私と一緒に住むことになっちゃう！","nextNodeIds":[725010227]},{"nodeId":725010227,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30160,"speakerName":"朝霧","textMapHash":1291015922,"text":"彼女が作る緋櫻茶漬けとか、本当に無理なの。旅人！私を助けてよ！","nextNodeIds":[725010228]},{"nodeId":725010228,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1959340482,"text":"わ、分かった…","nextNodeIds":[725010229]},{"nodeId":725010229,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30160,"speakerName":"朝霧","textMapHash":2215159290,"text":"ふぅ…よかった。ちょっと待っててね、帳面を探すから…","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7250102,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJ